https：//github.com/openclaw/openclaw/releases/tag/v2026.5.22`,category:"AI",tags:["安全"],url:"https://x.com/openclaw/status/2058397616124072274",source:"X：OpenClaw (@openclaw)",image:null,time:"2026-05-24T04:00:09.000Z",id:8},{title:"StepAudio 2.5实时语音发布：副语言感知与人格化交互",summary:"StepAudio 2.5 Realtime是一款实时语音模型，能够深度理解用户语音中的语气、语速、停顿乃至微表情等副语言特征。它支持通过API接入自定义人格，允许设定个性、背景故事和语言风格，并提供了上万种原生人格选项，可组合出数百万种特征。产品还内置了5个可直接体验的预设人格，并经过RLHF调优，确保在复杂的角色扮演压力测试中也能保持角色一致性。该模型支持中文和英文。",category:"AI",tags:["多模态"],url:"https://x.com/StepFun_ai/status/2058303294544425197",source:"X：阶跃星辰 StepFun (@StepFun_ai)",image:null,time:"2026-05-23T21:45:21.000Z",id:9},{title:"Replit Agent与Squidler集成，实现全自动化AI质量保障",summary:"Replit Agent与Squidler已完成集成，形成一套完整的AI驱动质量保障闭环。用户可通过自然语言描述应用功能，由Replit Agent负责构建。构建完成后，Squidler会像真实用户一样对线上应用进行自动化测试，无需编写任何测试脚本。测试中发现的问题会自动反馈给Replit Agent进行修复。该流程已通过Squidler加入Replit的MCP库正式上线，实现了从构建、测试到修复的全自动化，显著降低了应用测试与维护的门槛。",category:"AI",tags:["Agent","设计"],url:"https://x.com/Replit/status/2058261705998602548",source:"X：Replit (@Replit)",image:null,time:"2026-05-23T19:00:06.000Z",id:10}],Qa=[{name:"affaan-m/ECC",description:"多语言支持，JavaScript 编程",language:"JavaScript",stars:190947,starsToday:1673,forks:29548,url:"https://github.com/affaan-m/ECC",rank:1},{name:"perplexityai/bumblebee",description:"macOS/Linux 软件元数据收集器",language:"Go",stars:2208,starsToday:840,forks:171,url:"https://github.com/perplexityai/bumblebee",rank:2},{name:"FoundZiGu/GuJumpgate",description:"全自动 GPT Plus 注册扩展",language:"JavaScript",stars:2367,starsToday:276,forks:657,url:"https://github.com/FoundZiGu/GuJumpgate",rank:3},{name:"openclaw/openclaw",description:"个人 AI 助手，多平台支持",language:"TypeScript",stars:374438,starsToday:227,forks:77910,url:"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw",rank:4},{name:"public-apis/public-apis",description:"免费公共 API 资源库",language:"Python",stars:437015,starsToday:175,forks:47900,url:"https://github.com/public-apis/public-apis",rank:5},{name:"ollama/ollama",description:"开源模型构建工具",language:"Go",star